es they don't have sponsors  this is an impressive group but not just  because they rank fourth in the country  their Club can't afford to pay them so  they play purely For the Love of the  Game  they may be indoors and a court may be  smaller than a field but coaches say the  game is Close Quarters relying more on  technique and creativity  so for women accustomed to using brain  over Brawn it is second nature  [Music]  from all over the country from all walks  of life sharing a single passion  snapshot of Iraqi Unity  investing more in women's Athletics they  say means investing in the country's  future  Babylon Iraq

